            /* Compiler Settings, reachable from THIS program at last. The dialog is SysFile-backed,
               so the choice was always shared - what this program lacked was any way to CHANGE it,
               and a wrong or missing compiler meant starting TestBench or the FlexTron board to
               repair something both of them then read back.

               CompilerSetup.dg, not its FT twin: this menu belongs to the public program, and that
               file split is what keeps FlexTron out of the published repo.

               The same block as TestBench.src's, which got it first (Nils 2026-08-28) - and where
               the comment describing TestBench belongs. */
            Object oCompilerSetup_Menuitem is a cCJMenuItem
                Set psCaption to "&Compiler Settings"
